@startuml

skinparam backgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  BorderColor #0b3c5d
  BorderThickness 1.5
  FontColor #0b3c5d
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
  StartColor #0b3c5d
  EndColor #0b3c5d
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #0b3c5d
  FontColor #1e293b
  FontSize 11
  Thickness 1.5
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #fef3c7
  BorderColor #d97706
  FontColor #92400e
  FontSize 11
  BorderThickness 1
}


state ReadyForPickup
state Delivered #dcfce7
state DeliveryFailed #fee2e2

state OutForDelivery {
  OutForDelivery : <color:#0284c7>**entry /** startGPSTracking()</color>
  OutForDelivery : <color:#0284c7>**entry /** notifyCustomer("Rider En Route")</color>
  OutForDelivery : <color:#475569>**do /** streamRiderGPSCoordinates()</color>
  OutForDelivery : <color:#dc2626>**exit /** stopGPSTracking()</color>
  OutForDelivery : <color:#dc2626>**exit /** logDropoffTimestamp()</color>
}

ReadyForPickup -right-> OutForDelivery : courierPickUp()

OutForDelivery -right-> Delivered : confirmDelivery()\n[atCustomerAddress]

OutForDelivery -down-> DeliveryFailed : addressNotFound()\n[timeout > 30m]

note top of OutForDelivery
  <color:#0b3c5d>**Guaranteed Lifecycle Hooks:**</color>
  • **entry:** Fires on arrival from any source path
  • **do:** Continuous ongoing activity while in state
  • **exit:** Guaranteed cleanup on departure via ANY path
end note
@enduml
